---
import Page from "../layouts/Page.astro";
import { SITE } from "../config/site";
---
<Page
  title="Disclaimer"
  eyebrow="The fine print"
  description="How we work, how the Site is funded, and the limits of the information we provide."
  updated="November 12, 2026"
>
  <h2>General information only</h2>
  <p>
    The guides on {SITE.name} are for general educational purposes. We work hard to keep them accurate and up to
    date, but devices, apps and settings change often. We can't guarantee that every step will match your device
    exactly. Follow our guides at your own discretion, and back up important information before making changes.
  </p>

  <h2>Not affiliated with any brand</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is an independent website. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Apple, Google,
    Microsoft, Samsung, Meta, WhatsApp, Zoom, any Linux distribution or any other company mentioned on the Site.
    All product names, logos and trademarks belong to their respective owners.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    The Site shows ads through Google AdSense and other ad partners. Ads are clearly labeled
    "Advertisement." We don't choose the specific ads you see and don't endorse the products advertised.
  </p>

  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    Some links on the Site may be affiliate links. If you click one and make a purchase, we may earn a small
    commission <strong>at no extra cost to you</strong>. As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases.
    We only recommend products we believe are genuinely helpful, and commissions never influence our advice.
  </p>

  <h2>Security and scam information</h2>
  <p>
    Our scam safety guides help you recognize common warning signs, but no guide can cover every scam. If you
    think you've been scammed, contact your bank and the relevant authorities right away. In the US, you can
    report fraud at <a href="https://reportfraud.ftc.gov" rel="noopener" target="_blank">ReportFraud.ftc.gov</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    We sometimes link to other websites. We aren't responsible for their content or privacy practices.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Email us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</Page>
